From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thongass000 <tienthong2004@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 00:53:45 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] EpdgService: Sync the Wi-Fi Calling switch from the
 framework

Start WfcSync when the service is created. It copies the framework's
Wi-Fi Calling switch and mode into EpdgService's provider, which
EpdgService and imsservice read; on AOSP nothing else writes them.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 smali/com/sec/epdg/EpdgService.smali | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali/com/sec/epdg/EpdgService.smali b/smali/com/sec/epdg/EpdgService.smali
index 53f1ba1..b406fc4 100644
--- a/smali/com/sec/epdg/EpdgService.smali
+++ b/smali/com/sec/epdg/EpdgService.smali
@@ -1072,6 +1072,8 @@
     .line 66
     invoke-direct {p0}, Lcom/sec/epdg/EpdgService;->initializeEpdgService()V
 
+    invoke-static {p0}, Lcom/sec/epdg/compat/EpdgCompat;->startWfcSync(Landroid/content/Context;)V
+
     .line 67
     return-void
 .end method
